<title>UK: SWIMMING-HAN XUE SETS WORLD SHORT-COURSE MARK.</title>
<headline>SWIMMING-HAN XUE SETS WORLD SHORT-COURSE MARK.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Han Xue of China broke her own women's 50 metres breaststroke short-course world-best time at a World Cup swimming meeting on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Han clocked 30.88 seconds to beat the mark of 30.98 she set in Beijing on January 11, 1996.</p>
